AI LitReview
==============

AI LitReview is a collaborative, web-based tool for AI-assisted Systematic
Literature Reviews (SLRs) in Software Engineering and related fields. It
supports protocol definition, study import, duplicate removal, initial and
final study selection (title/abstract and full-text PDF), structured data
extraction, and RAG-based report generation, with optional LLMs via OpenRouter
or local Ollama.

Public instance: https://ailitreview.dzp.net.br

Copyright (c) 2024-2026 Anderson Deizepe, Katia Romero Felizardo, and Roberto Pereira

The user interface is based on the Materio admin template (ThemeSelection),
which remains under its own MIT license.

